      },
      "question": "Read the extract and answer the questions.\n\n*If when you're walking round your yard*\n*You meet a creature there,*\n*Who hugs you very, very hard,*\n*Be sure it is a Bear.*\n\n(i) Which animal is described?\n\n(ii) How does it greet you?\n\n(iii) Why is the hug dangerous?\n\n(iv) Find the repeated word.\n\n(v) What word does the poet later use for this hug?",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "answer_steps": [
        "(i) The bear.",
        "(ii) It hugs you very, very hard.",
        "(iii) A bear's hug can crush and kill.",
        "(iv) 'very'.",
        "(v) Caress."
      ],
      "marking_scheme": [
        "(i) 1 mark",
        "(ii) 1 mark",
        "(iii) 1 mark",
        "(iv) 1 mark",
        "(v) 1 mark"
      ]
    },
